                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is all kinds of janked up. \nIt feels like a pre-alpha, but apparently it's not.\n\nThe movement is clunky and feels unresponsive.\nThe controls are bananas in the bad way.\nThe graphics are this weird, jarring blend of hand-drawn sketchy backgrounds with low res 3d characters.\nThe animation is ridgid and doesn't time well (those jumps).\nThe music is okay and fits the theme. \n\nThe overall idea and design has a decent amount of potential, but it's not realised at all.\n\nIf you took the original Clay Fighter and made it worse, you'd still have better game than this, with similar themes and ideas.\n\nIt was originally pitched for mobile and that is about the only excuse I can think of for the quality. Especially the controls.",
